                                      MANY TO MANY MAPPING


🔹 Relationship between Entities?
     - It defines how multiple entities are related to each other.
     - At least 2 entities required.

Many-to-Many kya hota hai?
   - Ek entity ke multiple records dusri entity se related hote hain.
   - Aur dusri entity ke bhi multiple records pehli entity se related hote hain.
Simple Words
👉 Many Applicants → Many Jobs
👉 Many Jobs → Many Applicants


Real-Time Examples
      - Ek Student multiple Courses kar sakta hai, aur ek Course me multiple Students hote hain.
      - Ek User multiple Roles le sakta hai, aur ek Role multiple Users ko mil sakta hai.
      - Ek Applicant multiple Jobs apply kar sakta hai, aur ek Job multiple Applicants ko mil sakta hai.

Many-to-Many Diagram :

                 MANY TO MANY

      +----------------------+        +----------------------+
      |      Applicant        |        |        Jobs          |
      +----------------------+        +----------------------+
      | id (PK)               |        | id (PK)               |
      | name                  |        | title                 |
      | email                 |        | company               |
      | mobile                |        | location              |
      +----------------------+        +----------------------+
                *  ----------------------  *
                           |
                           |
                +---------------------------+
                |     applicant_jobs        |
                +---------------------------+
                | applicant_id (FK)          |
                | job_id (FK)                |
                +---------------------------+
👉 Many-to-Many me 3rd table mandatory hoti hai (Join Table).


🧭 Many-to-Many Mapping Types :
      1️⃣ Unidirectional Many-to-Many
      👉 Sirf ek entity ko dusri entity ka reference pata hota hai.

👤 Applicant Entity :
---------------------
@Entity
public class Applicant {

    @Id
    @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
    private Long id;

    private String name;

    @ManyToMany
    @JoinTable(
        name = "applicant_jobs",
        joinColumns = @JoinColumn(name = "applicant_id"),
        inverseJoinColumns = @JoinColumn(name = "job_id")
    )
    private List<Job> jobs;
}

💼 Job Entity :
---------------
@Entity
public class Job {

    @Id
    @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
    private Long id;

    private String title;
}
👉 Job ko Applicant ka reference nahi pata.


        2️⃣ Bidirectional Many-to-Many
        👉 Dono entities ek dusre ko janti hain.

👤 Applicant Entity (Owning Side) :
-----------------------------------
@Entity
public class Applicant {

    @Id
    @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
    private Long id;

    private String name;

    @ManyToMany
    @JoinTable(
        name = "applicant_jobs",
        joinColumns = @JoinColumn(name = "applicant_id"),
        inverseJoinColumns = @JoinColumn(name = "job_id")
    )
    private List<Job> jobs;
}

💼 Job Entity (Inverse Side) :
------------------------------
@Entity
public class Job {

    @Id
    @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
    private Long id;

    private String title;

    @ManyToMany(mappedBy = "jobs")
    private List<Applicant> applicants;
}

📌 Owning Side vs Inverse Side :
| Side         | Meaning                     |
| ------------ | --------------------------- |
| Owning Side  | Join Table create karta hai |
| Inverse Side | mappedBy wala side          |
👉 Join table Owning Side decide karta hai.

🔹 Important Annotations :
✅ @ManyToMany
    Many-to-Many relationship define karta hai.
✅ @JoinTable
    Join table create karta hai.
✅ joinColumns
    Current entity ka FK.
✅ inverseJoinColumns
    Other entity ka FK.
✅ mappedBy
    Inverse side batata hai.


🚨 Circular JSON Problem (Many-to-Many) :
        Applicant → Job → Applicant → Job → ...
Solution:
       @JsonManagedReference
       @JsonBackReference
            or
       @JsonIgnore

🔥 Interview Tip (Very Important) :
👉 Many-to-Many mapping internally 2 One-to-Many mappings hoti hai with a join table.







